OL,3,GNEWSANew large solar project announced
OL,4,Afor county
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public consultation has been launched
OL,7,Fon proposals for a large-scale solar
OL,8,Ffarm in West Lindsey.
OL,10,FRenewable energy developer Elgin said
OL,11,Fthe 99MW Stone Pit Lane Solar Farm,
OL,12,Fplanned on land south of Keelby, could
OL,13,Fgenerate enough renewable electricity
OL,14,Fto power up to 40,000 homes.
OL,16,FThe company said it was seeking
OL,17,Ffeedback from residents before
OL,18,Fsubmitting a planning application to
OL,19,FWest Lindsey District Council.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
